title: ParkKaito
---

<<declare $ParkKaito_interaction_times = 0>>

<<if $ParkKaito_interaction_times == 0>>
  Kaito: Hey. So I guess this is the park.
  -> Looks like a park to me.
  -> It's nice, right?
  Kaito: Yeah, it's pretty cool. I like the ducks.
  Kaito: The old lady over there had me write a wish to put in the tree.
  You: What did you write?
  Kaito: At first I didn't really know. But then I started remembering why I used to care about things.
  Kaito: My little brother. He was always such a bundle of joy. Then he got cancer, and...
  Kaito: After I saw someone like him suffer so much, I lost the will to care. I didn't see the point.
  Kaito: I wrote that I hope to see him again, after the world ends.
  -> I hope you do.
  -> I'm sure you'll find him.
  Kaito: Thanks, man.
  <<set $ParkKaito_interaction_times = 1>>
<<else>>
  Kaito: You know, this sunset's not a bad way to go.
<<endif>>


===
